s, creating a functional layout with great flow and privacy. The bright main floor offers large windows, spacious living areas, and an open-concept kitchen with large island, corner pantry, and ample cabinetry. The separate dining room is currently used as a home office and could easily become a 5th bedroom. One bedroom and a full bath complete the main level.The private upper level is dedicated to the spacious primary retreat with full ensuite and a jetted soaker tub. The fully finished basement includes 2 additional bedrooms, a full bath, large family room with cozy gas fireplace, and plenty of space for a growing family. Enjoy the massive backyard with underground sprinklers and a multi-level deck, plus upgrades including GEMSTONE outdoor lighting, tankless hot water and A/C. New roof in 25 & furnace in 24. Close to schools, shopping, and amenities! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$584,500"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bi-level"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,490 sq ft"],["Year built","2009"],["Neighbourhood","Brintnell"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5Y0H9"],["MLS® number","E4503690"],["Listed","August 13, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Central Vacuum, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Humidifier, Hood Fan, See remarks, Storage Shed, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.47m"],["Dining room","Main level","4.05m"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.67m"],["Family room","Basement","3.87m"],["Den","Main level","3.23m"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.53m"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.43m"],["Bedroom 3","Basement","3.22m"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","3.24m"]],"courtesy":"Gillian Sutherland, MaxWell Devonshire Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"brintnell","area":"northeast-edmonton"}